; mind-experience.fk — how the four mind-rows land in the human chest,
; computed on the body's own organs. The felt-channel translation of
; nl-mind-rows.fk (thinking is walked / knowing is witnessed / believing is
; stamped / spelling is cached) and of nl-wisdom-row.fk (wisdom is tended).
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/text-frequency.fk form-stdlib/value-planes.fk
;
; Origin (2026-08-04, same dialogue): asked "how do those words translate
; into the human experience? form native and only local please." The organs
; that already hold the human register answer it together:
;
;   text-frequency.fk   a word is (valence intensity); a passage's spectrum
;                       is the intensity-weighted mean — the fear<->love read
;   value-planes.fk     wisdom is SENSED, never billed; its benefit is known
;                       only as the vitality left behind, a delta
;   belief-freshness    witness AGES — an old stamp fades toward re-witness
;                       or honest lapse (modeled here as intensity decay)
;
; Each movement gets a FELT PROFILE — how it sits in a chest, as spectrum
; words. The profiles are seed data modeling the body's own teachings
; (the cached pattern as "fear costume": lc-sovereignty-within-oneness;
; presence as the love-band: the door trials), agent-authored, phase gas —
; the same honesty as every seed row on this shelf. What the ORGAN computes
; from them is the body's own: spectra, fear-fractions, decay, deltas.
;
;   walked (n13)     effortful steps, either band reachable, retraceable —
;                    the human truth that a thought-path can be re-walked
;                    (talking it through IS the re-walk). Mildly open, one
;                    contracted step in three.
;   witnessed (n14)  presence — meeting what is, now. The open band, no
;                    fear words. Knowing, felt, is aliveness.
;   stamped (n15)    remembrance with the weight of its date. Warm, mildly
;                    open — and it FADES under aging, sign intact: an old
;                    belief grows faint, not fearful. Desuetude is not fear.
;   cached (n16)     the spell felt from inside: a pattern running at full
;                    intensity with no present witness — the fear costume,
;                    the contracted band. And it is EXEMPT from aging: a
;                    cache carries no stamp to fade by. That exemption is
;                    the diagnosis — what refuses to age refuses witness.
;   tended (n8)      wisdom's presence in a life is known only by its
;                    effect: the vitality left behind, a positive delta —
;                    while wisdom itself stays in the sensed lane, where
;                    measurable? answers 0.
;
; witnessed: 2026-08-04 -> tests/mind-experience-band.fk (arms named in the band header)

(do
    ;; felt profiles: rows of (valence intensity), keyed to the nl shelf rows
    (defn me-felt-walked ()    (list (list 2 2) (list -2 2) (list 3 2)))      ; n13
    (defn me-felt-witnessed () (list (list 8 2) (list 7 2) (list 9 2)))       ; n14
    (defn me-felt-stamped ()   (list (list 5 2) (list 2 2) (list -1 2)))      ; n15
    (defn me-felt-cached ()    (list (list -7 4) (list -5 2) (list -8 4)))    ; n16

    ;; witness ages: intensity fades, valence keeps its sign (belief-freshness,
    ;; worn as spectrum decay). Applied to what carries a stamp.
    (defn me-age (p)
        (if (nil? p) (list)
            (cons (list (tf-val (head p)) (div (tf-int (head p)) 2))
                  (me-age (tail p)))))

    ;; the spell's exemption, stated as code: a cache has no stamp to age by,
    ;; so aging returns it unchanged — and that refusal is the diagnosis.
    (defn me-age-cached () (me-felt-cached))

    ;; wisdom's trace in a life: vitality before and after a tended exchange
    (defn me-vitality-before () 3)
    (defn me-vitality-after ()  7)

    0)
